/* 照片占位：纯 CSS 场景，不依赖任何图片资源。
   接上真实照片后，传 src 即可自动换成 <image>。 */
:host {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
}

.ph {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  height: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: #0A1330;
}

.ph-img {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  top: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
}

.art { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; }

.vig {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  top: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  background: radial-gradient(120% 82% at 50% 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 38%, rgba(3, 6, 20, 0.5) 100%);
}

.ph-label {
  position: absolute;
  left: 16rpx;
  bottom: 12rpx;
  font-size: 20rpx;
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
  letter-spacing: 0.5rpx;
}

/* 底色 */
.ph-field { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0A1330 0%, #0B1B44 26%, #0F2C66 52%, #0A2049 76%, #061530 100%); }
.ph-team { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #080E2A 0%, #0D1C4A 34%, #0F2C66 64%, #081734 100%); }
.ph-empty { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0B0F2A 0%, #101F4B 46%, #0A1A3D 100%); }
.ph-trophy { background: radial-gradient(62% 56% at 50% 40%, #4A3A18 0%, #1A1508 58%, #08080F 100%); }
.ph-celebration { background: radial-gradient(72% 62% at 50% 56%, #25325F 0%, #0C1030 68%, #07091A 100%); }
.ph-bus { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2A2140 0%, #1B1B3E 44%, #101A38 100%); }
.ph-hands { background: radial-gradient(54% 52% at 42% 46%, #4B3A2E 0%, #16233E 58%, #080E22 100%); }
.ph-board { background: linear-gradient(160deg, #0C1A38 0%, #12264F 52%, #081227 100%); }
.ph-locker { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0A0F28 0%, #14224A 56%, #0A1330 100%); }
.ph-mud { background: linear-gradient(160deg, #0E1930 0%, #1E2A3A 42%, #0A1424 100%); }
.ph-portrait { background: linear-gradient(200deg, #101C42 0%, #0A1030 58%, #070A20 100%); }
.ph-ring { background: radial-gradient(60% 60% at 50% 50%, #1A1A46 0%, #0B0B2A 62%, #06061A 100%); }

/* 球场：横向码线 */
.pitch {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  height: 54%;
  background: repeating-linear-gradient(
    180deg,
    rgba(163, 196, 240, 0.10) 0,
    rgba(163, 196, 240, 0.10) 3rpx,
    rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 3rpx,
    rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 92rpx
  );
}

/* 球员剪影 */
.fig {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 10%;
  width: 30rpx;
  height: 96rpx;
  background: #040A1A;
  border-radius: 14rpx 14rpx 6rpx 6rpx;
}
.fig::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: 50%;
  top: -18rpx;
  width: 24rpx;
  height: 24rpx;
  margin-left: -12rpx;
  background: #040A1A;
  border-radius: 50%;
}

/* 更衣室球衣 */
.jersey {
  position: absolute;
  top: 20%;
  width: 17%;
  height: 44%;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #1B2C62, #0C1738);
  border-radius: 10rpx 10rpx 24rpx 24rpx;
  box-shadow: inset 0 -8rpx 20rpx rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
}
.jersey::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: 50%;
  top: -14rpx;
  width: 26rpx;
  height: 14rpx;
  margin-left: -13rpx;
  border-radius: 3rpx 3rpx 0 0;
  background: rgba(190, 210, 245, 0.6);
}

/* 奖杯 */
.cup {
  position: absolute;
  left: 50%;
  top: 34%;
  width: 108rpx;
  height: 108rpx;
  margin-left: -54rpx;
  background: linear-gradient(160deg, #F8E2A4, #C9973F 70%, #8E6522);
  border-radius: 14rpx 14rpx 48rpx 48rpx;
  box-shadow: 0 0 40rpx rgba(248, 226, 164, 0.28);
}
.cup-foot {
  position: absolute;
  left: 50%;
  top: 68%;
  width: 132rpx;
  height: 20rpx;
  margin-left: -66rpx;
  border-radius: 6rpx;
  background: linear-gradient(160deg, #F8E2A4, #A87C2E);
}

/* 彩带点 */
.dot {
  position: absolute;
  width: 10rpx;
  height: 10rpx;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
}

/* 大巴车窗 + 落日 */
.win {
  position: absolute;
  left: 12%;
  right: 12%;
  top: 18%;
  height: 48%;
  border: 4rpx solid rgba(196, 214, 248, 0.45);
  border-radius: 16rpx;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0));
}
.sun {
  position: absolute;
  right: 22%;
  top: 40%;
  width: 44rpx;
  height: 44rpx;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #F2D27A;
  box-shadow: 0 0 48rpx rgba(242, 210, 122, 0.5);
}

/* 队徽环 */
.ring {
  position: absolute;
  left: 50%;
  top: 50%;
  width: 200rpx;
  height: 200rpx;
  margin: -100rpx 0 0 -100rpx;
  border: 6rpx solid rgba(232, 200, 122, 0.85);
  border-radius: 50%;
  box-shadow: 0 0 50rpx rgba(232, 200, 122, 0.22), inset 0 0 40rpx rgba(232, 200, 122, 0.16);
}
.ring-x {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  top: 50%;
  margin-top: -46rpx;
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 92rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #E8C87A;
  font-family: "Songti SC", serif;
}

/* 泥地脚印 */
.boot {
  position: absolute;
  width: 40rpx;
  height: 22rpx;
  border-radius: 8rpx;
  background: rgba(6, 12, 26, 0.55);
  transform: rotate(-18deg);
}
